  "interpretation": "The candidate produced four B-splines after camera motion and map growth. The first goal-adjacent snapshot and the two subsequent pre-motion snapshots still had unknown samples along the later spline centerlines; snapshot 03, 0.91 s before the first spline start, classified all sampled centerline cells as known free. This is consistent with conservative unknown handling awaiting observation, but voxel timestamps and exact planner-time map readback are absent. Inflation increased the goal snapshot mask from 6,673 voxels in #305 to 32,394 here. Offline SDF analysis reports only 0.3–33 mm nominal-sphere wall clearance across the four splines, with 0.19–0.27 m box clearance; direct chords intersect the box. Repeated optimizer collision/rebound warnings, one internal emergency-stop/recovery transition and centerline overlap with the separate inflation mask prevent safety or planning acceptance.",
  "qualification": "Planner-only experiment; no trajectory server, controller, PX4, actuator, online truth subscription, or GOAL C/D/E/F acceptance.",
  "limitations": [
    "The goal-adjacent snapshot source stamp was 2.299 s after the goal; the scene remained stationary until the first force command at 15.676 s. It is near-goal static-scene context, not exact same-stamp evidence.",
    "No voxel retains its individual observation time. Snapshot 03 precedes the first spline by 0.910 s but is not an exact planning-time map.",
    "Offline alignment is one fixed-scale SE(3) fit across 492 pairs; it is a diagnostic measure of this force-driven sensor fixture, not a validated world-frame clearance bound.",
    "The 0.5 m inflation is a rounded nominal-sphere candidate only; it adds 18 mm beyond the nominal 0.48194 m sphere and excludes map, tracking, braking, rotor and cable margins.",
    "EGO recorded 6,290 first-three-control-points-in-obstacle warnings, 3,395 direction-generation warnings, 583 terminal-point-in-obstacle warnings, and one internal emergency stop followed by recovery; no EGO odom/depth timeout was recorded.",
    "All four published centerlines had zero occupied samples in the archived snapshots; at snapshot 03 they had zero unknown samples but 6–171 samples overlapping the separate inflated mask."
